  "stem": "<p>If <math alttext=\"6 n equals 12\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t\t<mi>n</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>12</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, what is the value of <math alttext=\"n plus 4\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>n</mi>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mn>4</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>",
